R music 1.0.0

This frontend is a modified version of Folia, created by chthollyphile and
contributors. Upstream: https://github.com/chthollyphile/folia-major
The source supplied in folia-major-main.zip identifies commit
9a01e788ed52d25ea01b1f0d37934e5e371ae82b and package version 0.7.18.

R music uses Folia's React interface, player components, visualizers,
lyric processing and browser integration, adapted for Roylyl's Music catalog
and the /rmusic/ GitHub Pages path. These adaptations were made by Roylyl
on 2026-10-13 and include product branding, static catalog integration,
independent browser storage, PWA scope and responsive UI changes.
They also include an adapted R monogram, per-song share pages, native system
sharing entry points and paused restoration of shared tracks.
